      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/ecb155/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-09-16T02:52:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>After spending so much time at the GTG booth both this year and last at PAX Prime, I definitely would like to throw my name in for PAX South and/or PAX East. I just need to confirm the time off with my work. Since I've only ever attended PAX in Seattle, they're not used to me taking weekends in other times of the year, and due to the nature of our work we have to schedule who's going to be where and when several months in advance. Just going to leave this post here for now, and once I hear back from my boss I will send an email to confirm.</p>",
